360 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (Online and hybrid learning have grown rapidly, especially after the COVID-19 pandemic. Massive Open Online Course \(MOOCs\) have become more popular in the past five years. However, many platforms still do not fully use AI to provide personalized learning, instant feedback, or smart tutoring. This leads to generic lessons, slow responses, and low student engagement. This project aims to close these gaps by implementing effective AI practices to create a more adaptive and interactive learning experience.)
/E (Online and hybrid learning have grown rapidly, especially after the COVID-19 pandemic. Massive Open Online Course \(MOOCs\) have become more popular in the past five years. However, many platforms still do not fully use AI to provide personalized learning, instant feedback, or smart tutoring. This leads to generic lessons, slow responses, and low student engagement. This project aims to close these gaps by implementing effective AI practices to create a more adaptive and interactive learning experience.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
